- The shipped launcher calls org.freedesktop.portal.FileChooser and
  org.freedesktop.portal.Settings, but no portal frontend was declared,
  so file dialogs fail with "No such interface" on a minimal install.
  Add weak Recommends on xdg-desktop-portal and
  xdg-desktop-portal-gtk in the RPM and DEB recipes.

